From 88400a28008a10979aeb1b80289c0ea394efa0f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard DEMONGEOT <richard@rdem-systems.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:31:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 075/120] docs: official builds are published and signed by
 RDEM Systems only

Every README now says where official Nimbus Backup releases are
published (rdemsystems/NimbusBackupClient, nimbus.rdem-systems.com),
that official Windows binaries are code-signed by RDEM SYSTEMS since
0.4.1 and how to check it, and that forks of the project still carrying
the Nimbus Backup name and RDEM Systems as author are not made, signed
or supported by RDEM Systems.
